00:19:23,290 --> 00:19:26,390
You invertebrate festering lowlife.

256
00:19:27,370 --> 00:19:30,830
Oh, don't try to charm me with one of
your stupid Frankenstein impressions

257
00:19:30,830 --> 00:19:31,830
